Feature: Create Resource Type

  Background:
    Given The following API keys exist for the Resource Admin:
      | 22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552 |
      | 22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57722 |

  Scenario: Positive: create Resource Type with all required fields.
    Given Resource Admin wants to create a new Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-RT",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
         "name": "FAQ-RT",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type is created successfully with response code 201
    And return the created resource type
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-RT",
         "name": "FAQ-RT",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: create Resource Type with description: null
    Given Resource Admin wants to create a new Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-1",
         "name": "FAQ-1",
         "description": null,
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type is created successfully with response code 201
    And return the created resource type
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-1",
         "name": "FAQ-1",
         "description": null,
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: create Resource Type with description: empty
    Given Resource Admin wants to create a new Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-2",
         "name": "FAQ-2",
         "description": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Resource Type
