      {
         "key": "FAQ-2",
         "name": "FAQ-2",
         "description": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: create Resource Type with description: blank (whitespace)
    Given Resource Admin wants to create a new Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
