         "key": "FAQ-3",
         "name": "FAQ-3",
         "description": "  ",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type is created successfully with response code 201
    And return the created resource type
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-3",
         "name": "FAQ-3",
         "description": "  ",
         "actions": [
            "view",
