      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type creation fails with response code 400
    And the response body includes status 400 and error message 'Bad Request'

  Scenario: Positive: Creation Multiple Resource Types with All Required Fields
    Given Resource Admin wants to create Multiple Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
      [
         {
            "key": "FAQ-5",
            "name": "FAQ-5",
            "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ]
         },
         {
            "key": "Term",
            "name": "Term",
            "description": "Term",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ]
         }
      ]
      """
    When The Resource Admin creates Multiple Resource Type
    Then The Resource Type create succeeded with response code 201
    And return the created multiple resource type
      """json
      {
      "results": [
           {
              "key": "FAQ-5",
              "name": "FAQ-5",
              "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
              "actions": [
                 "view",
                 "update",
                 "create",
                 "delete"
              ]
           },
           {
              "key": "Term",
              "name": "Term",
              "description": "Term",
              "actions": [
                 "view",
                 "update",
                 "create",
                 "delete"
              ]
           }
        ]
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: Creation Multiple Resource Types with All Required Fields Include tags
    Given Resource Admin wants to create Multiple Resource Type with the following attributes
      """json
      [
         {
            "key": "FAQ-52",
            "name": "FAQ-52",
            "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ],
            "tags": [
               "tag-FAQ-52",
               "tag-FAQ-52-1"
            ]
         },
         {
            "key": "Term2",
            "name": "Term2",
            "description": "Term",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ],
            "tags": [
              "tag-Term-52",
              "tag-Term-52-1"
            ]
         }
      ]
      """
    When The Resource Admin creates Multiple Resource Type
    Then The Resource Type create succeeded with response code 201
    And return the created multiple resource type
      """json
      {
      "results": [
           {
              "key": "FAQ-52",
              "name": "FAQ-52",
              "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
              "actions": [
                 "view",
                 "update",
                 "create",
                 "delete"
              ],
              "tags": [
               "tag-FAQ-52",
               "tag-FAQ-52-1"
              ]
           },
           {
              "key": "Term2",
              "name": "Term2",
              "description": "Term",
              "actions": [
                 "view",
                 "update",
                 "create",
                 "delete"
              ],
              "tags": [
                "tag-Term-52",
                "tag-Term-52-1"
              ]
           }
        ]
      }
      """

  Scenario: Negative: Creation Multiple Resource Type with request body: empty
    Given Resource Admin wants to create Multiple Resource Type with an empty request body
      """json
      []
      """
    When The Resource Admin creates Multiple Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type creation fails with response code 400
    And the error response body includes status 400 and error message 'Bad Request'

  Scenario: Negative: Creation Multiple Resource Type with request body: array size more than 100
    Given the Resource Admin wants to create Multiple Resource Type with more than 100 resource type data
      """json
      [
         {
            "key": "FAQ-M",
            "name": "FAQ-M",
            "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ]
         }
      ]
      """
    When The Resource Admin creates Multiple Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type creation fails with response code 400
    And the error response body includes status 400 and error message 'Bad Request'

  Scenario: Negative: Creation Multiple Resource Type with request body: contains duplicate key
    Given Resource Admin wants to create Multiple Resource Type with Duplicate Key
      """json
      [
         {
            "key": "FAQ-M",
            "name": "FAQ-M",
            "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ]
         },
         {
            "key": "FAQ-M",
            "name": "FAQ-M",
            "description": "Frequently Asked Question 2",
            "actions": [
               "view",
               "update",
               "create",
               "delete"
            ]
         }
      ]
      """
    When The Resource Admin creates Multiple Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type creation fails with response code 409
    And verify whether data with key "FAQ-M" has been rolled back
    And the error response body includes status 409 and error message 'Conflict'
